span=\"4\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><ul class=\"flex flex-col justify-start items-start list-inside list-disc ml-4 mb-4\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><li class=\"mb-1\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">\u03b1<sub style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">1</sub>: peripheral vasoconstriction, \u2191 SVR</li><li class=\"mb-1\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">\u03b2<sub style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">1</sub>: \u2191 heart rate &amp; contractility, \u2191 cardiac output</li><li class=\"mb-1\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">\u03b2<sub style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">2</sub>: peripheral vasodilation, \u2193 SVR</li><li class=\"mb-1\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">D<sub style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">1</sub>: renal arteriolar vasodilation</li></ul></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-original-nbme-400/10 warm:hover:bg-brown-700/10 dark:hover:bg-white/15\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><p class=\"mb-4 text-start\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Agonist</strong></p></td><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><p class=\"mb-4 text-start\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Receptorbinding</strong></p></td><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><p class=\"mb-4 text-start\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Bloodpressure</strong></p></td><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><p class=\"mb-4 text-start\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Heartrate</strong></p></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-original-nbme-400